    "content": "@CoreFX Vehicle light emissive shader edits\n\nYou will be able to modify these options at runtime:\n- Headlight\n- Taillights\n- Brakelights\n- Indicators\n- Reverselights\n- Extra full beams\n- Defaultlights (old sirens, taxi & bus signs)\n- Sirenlights (new sirens)\n\n- Less invasive, just multiplies current values from visualsettings.dat, so probably will be compatible with ELS and other emissive mods.",
