    "content": "@CoreFX Streetlight overhaul - final update\n\n(debug and final color screenshots)\n\nModified over 100 shaders to add support of our new streetlight color change system via RenoDX menu\n- You will be able to edit three different layers of streetlights separately, color and intensity\n- Vanilla white & cyan lights are untouched\n- Separate global volume fog settings for foggy & smog weathers\n- Default preset will have a mix of white, yellow and light blue colored streetlights across the map\n\nComing to Enhanced as well",
